'''''Dendrobium''''' section '''''Dendrobium''''' is a [[Section (biology)|section]] of the genus ''[[Dendrobium]]''.<ref name="Tropicos">{{cite web | title=Tropicos | website=Tropicos | url=https://www.tropicos.org/name/23526014 | access-date=2022-05-30}}</ref><ref name=" The American Orchid Society 2016">{{cite web | title=Den. Sec. Dendrobium | website= The American Orchid Society | date=2016-03-23 | url=http://www.aos.org/orchids/orchids-a-to-z/letter-d/den-sec-dendrobium.aspx | ref={{sfnref | The American Orchid Society | 2016}} | access-date=2022-05-30}}</ref>

==Description==
Plants in this section have moderate length thin pseudobulbs with leaves at upper two thirds of the pseudobulb.<ref name="Orchids of New Guinea">{{cite web | title=Largest online collection of New Guinea orchids | website=Orchids of New Guinea | url=http://www.orchidsnewguinea.com/ | access-date=2022-05-30}}</ref>

==Distribution==
Plants from this section are found from [[India]] to [[New Guinea]] and [[Australia]] in the east and [[Japan]] and [[Korea]].

